==Notes==

*Added in [[patch]] 1.69
*Despite its description, the critical multiplier is x3.
*The "1d0" means no base damage is dealt (though, like any other weapon, the total damage has a minimum of 1).  This phenomena is usually limited to [[creature weapon]]s without a [[monster damage]] property.
*This item is not supported by feats, nor does it pass the scripted test for being a melee weapon.  Thus it is not affected by [[magic weapon]], [[flame weapon]], or other spells that can only target melee weapons.